# The build context is the repo root as of M3 -- the Containerfile needs both
# os/files/ and shell/, so it cannot be scoped to os/ any more.
#
# That makes this file load-bearing rather than tidiness. The context is read
# over the Windows filesystem bridge from /mnt/c, where every byte is slow, and
# .git alone is several MB and only grows. dev-setup.md's claim that the context
# is "a few KB" was true when it was os/ and is only still true because of this.

.git/
.github/
.claude/
docs/
scripts/
out/
README.md
LICENSE

# Disk images: multi-GB each, and make-installer.sh writes them into the repo's
# out/ by default.
*.raw
*.img
*.vhdx
*.qcow2
*.vmdk
*.iso

# A developer's local Godot import cache. The shell-export stage removes this
# after COPY as well, so this is the belt to that braces: an editor-generated
# .godot/ carries absolute paths from the machine that made it.
shell/.godot/
shell/.import/

# Editor and OS noise
.DS_Store
*.swp
